1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,154
Two federal agents watched a matte-black

2
00:00:03,174 --> 00:00:05,406
triangle rise over a ridge in total

3
00:00:05,426 --> 00:00:05,921
silence,

4
00:00:06,391 --> 00:00:06,965
hover,

5
00:00:07,435 --> 00:00:09,587
and dive into a canyon at what they

6
00:00:09,607 --> 00:00:11,572
