75
00:02:42,584 --> 00:02:43,873
6 to 9 feet long,

76
00:02:44,343 --> 00:02:45,973
and only 1 to 2 feet thick.

77
00:02:46,543 --> 00:02:49,072
By their terrain estimates, it was

78
00:02:49,092 --> 00:02:52,147
somewhere between 1.4 and 3.2 miles away.

79
00:02:52,716 --> 00:02:53,482
Phase two.

80
00:02:53,952 --> 00:02:56,586
About 200 to 300 feet above the ridge, it

81
00:02:56,606 --> 00:02:58,399
