82
00:02:58,869 --> 00:02:59,566
and hovered.

83
00:03:00,036 --> 00:03:02,569
For about twenty seconds it held still: no

84
00:03:02,589 --> 00:03:03,906
drift, no oscillation.

85
00:03:04,476 --> 00:03:06,746
Through the thermal monocular, the whole

86
00:03:06,766 --> 00:03:08,864
airframe showed one even temperature.

87
00:03:09,334 --> 00:03:11,955
No hot spots, no engine heat, no exhaust

88
00:03:11,975 --> 00:03:12,351
plume.

89
00:03:12,921 --> 00:03:13,703
Phase three.

90
00:03:14,173 --> 00:03:16,228
It went from hovering straight into

91
00:03:16,248 --> 00:03:18,422
high-speed horizontal flight, with no

92
00:03:18,442 --> 00:03:19,964
visible build-up of speed,

93
00:03:20,434 --> 00:03:20,992
banked,

94
00:03:21,462 --> 00:03:23,193
and dropped into a canyon, hugging the

95
00:03:23,213 --> 00:03:23,562
terrain,

96
00:03:24,032 --> 00:03:26,487
in a way the memo compares to low-altitude

97
00:03:26,507 --> 00:03:27,843
terrain-masking flight.

98
00:03:28,413 --> 00:03:30,210
That last phase lasted two to three

99
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:30,625
seconds.

100
00:03:31,095 --> 00:03:33,356
The agents compared its speed to a fighter

101
00:03:33,376 --> 00:03:33,573
jet.

102
00:03:34,043 --> 00:03:35,668
But the memo is careful to add:

103
00:03:36,138 --> 00:03:38,037
no instrumented speed measurement was

104
00:03:38,057 --> 00:03:38,504
obtained.

105
00:03:39,075 --> 00:03:41,591
The infrared lock was lost because the

106
00:03:41,611 --> 00:03:44,327
object accelerated out of the monocular's

107
00:03:44,347 --> 00:03:45,729
narrow field of view.

108
00:03:46,312 --> 00:03:48,358
And through all of it, the memo says,

109
00:03:48,378 --> 00:03:50,369
there was absolute acoustic silence.

110
00:03:50,938 --> 00:03:53,662
The FBI file includes nine images of this.

111
00:03:54,132 --> 00:03:55,954
They are not photographs of the object.

112
00:03:56,424 --> 00:03:58,723
They show the same dusk landscape, with a

113
00:03:58,743 --> 00:04:00,928
small black shape placed in a different

114
00:04:00,948 --> 00:04:01,889
spot in each one,

115
00:04:02,359 --> 00:04:03,024
rising,

116
00:04:03,494 --> 00:04:04,170
hovering,

117
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,078
and dropping toward the canyon.

118
00:04:06,998 --> 00:04:08,966
But there is a second account of the same

119
00:04:08,986 --> 00:04:09,354
evening.

120
00:04:09,974 --> 00:04:13,092
It is an FBI form called an FD-302.

121
00:04:13,562 --> 00:04:15,704
Attached to it is a written statement

122
00:04:15,724 --> 00:04:17,107
co-signed by two agents,

123
00:04:17,577 --> 00:04:18,834
quoted word for word.

124
00:04:19,404 --> 00:04:21,916
In their words, they almost immediately

125
00:04:21,936 --> 00:04:24,384
observed a substantial, nonreflective,

126
00:04:24,404 --> 00:04:26,266
dark black triangular object,

127
00:04:26,736 --> 00:04:28,708
most resembling a delta wing drone.

128
00:04:29,278 --> 00:04:32,083
Their wingspan estimate is broader: 9 to

129
00:04:32,103 --> 00:04:32,647
15 feet.

130
00:04:33,117 --> 00:04:35,225
Through the thermal device, they wrote, it

131
00:04:35,245 --> 00:04:37,302
appeared hotter than ambient temperature,

132
00:04:37,772 --> 00:04:40,161
with a completely consistent thermal

133
00:04:40,181 --> 00:04:42,904
signature across the entire airframe, and

134
00:04:42,924 --> 00:04:44,576
no visible exhaust gases.

135
00:04:45,146 --> 00:04:47,897
The ridge, they wrote, was about 3.2 miles

136
00:04:47,917 --> 00:04:48,227
west.

137
00:04:48,697 --> 00:04:51,407
The object climbed to about 200 feet above

138
00:04:51,427 --> 00:04:51,602
it,

139
00:04:52,072 --> 00:04:54,465
then moved into horizontal flight at a

140
00:04:54,485 --> 00:04:56,878
very significant velocity, approaching

141
00:04:56,898 --> 00:04:57,830
their position,

142
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:59,749
and descended to the southeast.

143
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:02,834
They lost sight of it about 1.5 miles

144
00:05:02,854 --> 00:05:03,176
away.

145
00:05:03,646 --> 00:05:06,591
Even the clock is different: the FBI

146
00:05:06,611 --> 00:05:09,968
