147
00:05:09,988 --> 00:05:11,532
the memo says 8:23.

148
00:05:12,002 --> 00:05:13,489
And here is the biggest difference.

149
00:05:14,059 --> 00:05:15,593
The FBI statement says:

150
00:05:16,176 --> 00:05:18,476
the total duration of the sighting was

151
00:05:18,496 --> 00:05:20,185
approximately three seconds.

152
00:05:20,755 --> 00:05:22,938
The Pentagon memo describes about ten

153
00:05:22,958 --> 00:05:24,129
seconds of climbing,

154
00:05:24,599 --> 00:05:25,936
twenty seconds of hovering,

155
00:05:26,406 --> 00:05:27,978
and two to three seconds of flight.

156
00:05:28,448 --> 00:05:29,497
Roughly half a minute.

157
00:05:30,067 --> 00:05:32,049
The documents do not explain the gap.

158
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:35,080
And the FBI statement ends with one more

159
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:35,403
line:

160
00:05:35,873 --> 00:05:38,521
neither agent detected any auditory output

161
00:05:38,541 --> 00:05:40,554
