162
00:05:41,124 --> 00:05:42,408
Unmanned aerial system.

163
00:05:42,878 --> 00:05:43,575
A drone.

164
00:05:44,045 --> 00:05:45,702
That is the agents' own description.

165
00:05:46,172 --> 00:05:47,290
It is not a finding.

166
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,977
Nobody, in either document, says what it

167
00:05:49,997 --> 00:05:50,201
was.

168
00:05:51,121 --> 00:05:52,725
Which brings us back to the canyon.

169
00:05:53,345 --> 00:05:55,735
No impact, no smoke, no dust, the memo

170
00:05:55,755 --> 00:05:56,053
says.

171
00:05:56,523 --> 00:05:59,100
And a ground survey of the canyon the next

172
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,327
morning found no wreckage, no ground

173
00:06:01,347 --> 00:06:03,678
scarring, and no damage to the plants.

174
00:06:04,248 --> 00:06:06,127
Then comes a note from the person who

175
00:06:06,147 --> 00:06:06,897
wrote the memo.

176
00:06:07,367 --> 00:06:09,668
Both agents, it says, have extensive

177
00:06:09,688 --> 00:06:12,311
experience working with drones, alongside

178
00:06:12,331 --> 00:06:14,955
government agencies and academic studies,

179
00:06:15,425 --> 00:06:17,644
and they regularly see ordinary aircraft

180
00:06:17,664 --> 00:06:18,596
around that site.

181
00:06:19,166 --> 00:06:20,554
On that hilltop, they told the

182
00:06:20,574 --> 00:06:21,164
interviewers,

183
00:06:21,634 --> 00:06:24,666
even a small drone, a quadcopter motor or

184
00:06:24,686 --> 00:06:27,494
a helicopter 1.4 miles away would have

185
00:06:27,514 --> 00:06:29,057
been clearly audible.

186
00:06:29,627 --> 00:06:31,795
They judged its size against the trees on

187
00:06:31,815 --> 00:06:32,863
the ridge behind it.

188
00:06:33,433 --> 00:06:36,018
And the memo reports none of the strange

189
00:06:36,038 --> 00:06:38,493
extras that fill a lot of UFO stories.

190
00:06:38,963 --> 00:06:41,094
No nausea, no headaches, no lost time.

191
00:06:41,564 --> 00:06:42,571
No odd smells.

192
00:06:43,041 --> 00:06:44,647
No interference with any of their

193
00:06:44,667 --> 00:06:45,140
