202
00:07:01,945 --> 00:07:02,843
or performance.

203
00:07:03,413 --> 00:07:04,558
Two trained observers.

204
00:07:05,028 --> 00:07:06,002
Two documents.

205
00:07:06,472 --> 00:07:08,108
One object nobody could name.

206
00:07:08,578 --> 00:07:10,043
And no video of it in the release.

207
00:07:10,963 --> 00:07:12,871
Here is the strange part of this release.

208
00:07:13,341 --> 00:07:15,833
The same ideas keep turning up, more than

209
00:07:15,853 --> 00:07:16,875
70 years earlier.

210
00:07:17,495 --> 00:07:20,501
The seventh batch is not only about 2026.

211
00:07:20,971 --> 00:07:23,798
About half of its 28 files are old Air

212
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:26,871
Force reports, from California to Sweden,

213
00:07:26,891 --> 00:07:29,343
Morocco, Alaska and Saudi Arabia.

214
00:07:29,913 --> 00:07:31,906
June 25, 1952.

215
00:07:32,246 --> 00:07:34,436
Santa Catalina Island, off Southern

216
00:07:34,456 --> 00:07:35,130
California.

217
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,689
Three Boy Scouts from a summer camp are

218
00:07:37,709 --> 00:07:38,825
hiking up a mountain.

219
00:07:39,395 --> 00:07:41,722
The Air Force report says they saw a

220
00:07:41,742 --> 00:07:44,396
silver object, faster than a conventional

221
00:07:44,416 --> 00:07:44,657
jet.

222
00:07:45,127 --> 00:07:46,470
There was no sound observed.

223
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:48,330
It made one climbing turn,

224
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,969
and then came what the report calls its

225
00:07:50,989 --> 00:07:52,766
