226
00:07:53,336 --> 00:07:55,331
The officer who filed it added a blunt

227
00:07:55,351 --> 00:07:55,596
note.

228
00:07:56,066 --> 00:07:58,089
No estimate of reliability could be

229
00:07:58,109 --> 00:07:58,672
attempted,

230
00:07:59,142 --> 00:08:01,359
and the experience of the observers was

231
00:08:01,379 --> 00:08:02,735
probably meager at best.

232
00:08:03,305 --> 00:08:06,445
Eighteen months later, in December 1953, a

233
00:08:06,465 --> 00:08:09,229
couple driving near Seymour, Indiana,

234
00:08:09,249 --> 00:08:10,733
reported two objects

235
00:08:11,203 --> 00:08:12,741
that hovered with complete level

236
00:08:12,761 --> 00:08:13,228
stability,

237
00:08:13,698 --> 00:08:15,835
and then left with what the report calls

238
00:08:15,855 --> 00:08:16,752
incredible speed.

239
00:08:17,322 --> 00:08:18,734
And about the sound, one line:

240
00:08:19,316 --> 00:08:21,665
none to the ear, although observers stood

241
00:08:21,685 --> 00:08:23,283
