247
00:08:33,998 --> 00:08:34,674
Silent.

248
00:08:35,144 --> 00:08:35,803
Hovering.

249
00:08:36,273 --> 00:08:37,589
Then gone, at great speed.

250
00:08:38,059 --> 00:08:40,617
The same three ideas, in reports written

251
00:08:40,637 --> 00:08:42,228
