261
00:09:02,815 --> 00:09:04,621
Then there is the file stamped Secret.

262
00:09:05,241 --> 00:09:06,925
January 1957.

263
00:09:07,395 --> 00:09:09,943
B-52 bombers were flying around the world

264
00:09:09,963 --> 00:09:10,945
