267
00:09:15,642 --> 00:09:19,565
They covered 24,325 miles in 45 hours and

268
00:09:19,585 --> 00:09:23,315
19 minutes, according to the Air Force.

269
00:09:23,885 --> 00:09:26,878
Over Saudi Arabia, at night, at 39,000

270
00:09:26,898 --> 00:09:27,275
feet,

271
00:09:27,745 --> 00:09:31,247
B-52 number 394, commanded by Lieutenant

272
00:09:31,267 --> 00:09:33,008
Colonel J.H. Morris,

273
00:09:33,478 --> 00:09:34,921
was about to meet its tanker.

274
00:09:35,491 --> 00:09:37,864
Just before the rendezvous, the gunner's

275
00:09:37,884 --> 00:09:40,077
