327
00:11:27,544 --> 00:11:29,912
In Alaska, a light seen west of Gambell,

328
00:11:29,932 --> 00:11:31,404
on Saint Lawrence Island:

329
00:11:31,874 --> 00:11:34,777
possibly, the report says, an unidentified

330
00:11:34,797 --> 00:11:37,700
