332
00:11:39,107 --> 00:11:41,139
And then there is a practical question in

333
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:41,740
these files:

334
00:11:42,210 --> 00:11:44,107
what happens when something falls out of

335
00:11:44,127 --> 00:11:44,491
