351
00:12:18,110 --> 00:12:20,676
On May 29, 1963, a memo went to the

352
00:12:20,696 --> 00:12:23,410
council's executive secretary, Doctor

353
00:12:23,430 --> 00:12:26,440
Edward Welsh, about a meeting with Arnold

354
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:29,470
Frutkin, NASA's director of international

355
00:12:29,490 --> 00:12:30,135
programs.

356
00:12:30,705 --> 00:12:32,987
Frutkin, the memo says, was now very

357
00:12:33,007 --> 00:12:34,522
