362
00:12:42,471 --> 00:12:44,808
And point four, still Frutkin's view as

363
00:12:44,828 --> 00:12:46,016
the memo records it:

364
00:12:46,598 --> 00:12:48,957
the Defense Department and the Air Force

365
00:12:48,977 --> 00:12:50,682
