371
00:13:02,108 --> 00:13:04,548
But it records a NASA official's view that

372
00:13:04,568 --> 00:13:06,715
NASA was meant to be the public face,

373
00:13:07,185 --> 00:13:09,472
while the draft guidelines sent foreign

374
00:13:09,492 --> 00:13:11,779
pieces to the Defense Department first,

375
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:12,548
for analysis.

376
00:13:13,469 --> 00:13:15,387
The last file is the strangest one.

377
00:13:16,007 --> 00:13:18,550
In March and April 2010, a team from a

378
00:13:18,570 --> 00:13:21,046
